* GEL-7072 / GEL-4072 - Laboratoire 4 : Bioelectronique
* Simulation AC de l'INA823 selon l'approche systemique (Question 6.2)
* Equation mode differentiel : V(OUT_D)/(V(POS_D) - V(NEG_D))
* Equation mode commun : V(OUT_CM)/((V(POS_CM) + V(NEG_CM))/2)

.title INA823 Systemic Bode Simulation

* Alimentations unipolaires
Vdd VDD 0 DC 3.3
Vref VREF 0 DC 1.65

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* SOURCE 1 : MODE DIFFERENTIEL (Entree purement differentielle)
* -------------------------------------------------------------
* Amplitude differentielle 1V AC (symetrique autour de VREF)
Vpos_d POS_D VREF AC 0.5 0
Vneg_d NEG_D VREF AC -0.5 0

* INA823 - Branche Differentielle
* Broches INA823 : 1:RG1, 2:IN-, 3:IN+, 4:V-, 5:REF, 6:OUT, 7:V+, 8:RG2
X_ina_d RG1_D NEG_D POS_D 0 VREF OUT_D VDD RG2_D INA823_MACRO
* Resistance de gain pour G = 10 : RG = 100k / (G-1) = 11.111k
Rg_d RG1_D RG2_D 11.111k

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* SOURCE 2 : MODE COMMUN (Entree purement mode commun)
* -------------------------------------------------------------
* Amplitude mode commun 1V AC sur les deux entrees
Vcm_src CM_IN VREF AC 1.0 0
Rpos_cm CM_IN POS_CM 0.001
Rneg_cm CM_IN NEG_CM 0.001

* INA823 - Branche Mode Commun
X_ina_cm RG1_CM NEG_CM POS_CM 0 VREF OUT_CM VDD RG2_CM INA823_MACRO
Rg_cm RG1_CM RG2_CM 11.111k

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* MACRO-MODELE INA823 (Comportemental conforme fiche technique TI)
* Broches : RG1 IN- IN+ V- REF OUT V+ RG2
* -------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt INA823_MACRO RG1 INM INP VM REF OUT VP RG2
* Impedance d'entree elevee
Rin_diff INP INM 1e12
Rin_cm1  INP VM  1e12
Rin_cm2  INM VM  1e12

* Etage differentiel : Gain G = 1 + 100k/RG
* Mesure du courant a travers RG via source nulle Vsens
Vsens RG1 RG1_int 0
* Calcul du gain dynamique G = 1 + 100k / R(RG1,RG2)
* Amplification differentielle de base (G=10)
E_diff N_diff 0 INP INM 10.0
* Pole dominant de bande passante INA823 a G=10 (fc = 380 kHz)
R_bw N_diff N_bw 1k
C_bw N_bw 0 4.188e-10

* Mode commun avec TRMC = 115 dB a DC, pole CMRR a 1 kHz (roll-off 20 dB/dec)
E_cm_sense N_cm 0 INP VM 0.5
E_cm_sense2 N_cm2 N_cm INM VM 0.5
* Attenuation de mode commun (Acm_dc = 10 / 10^(115/20) = 1.78e-5 V/V = -95 dB)
E_cm_att N_cm_raw 0 N_cm2 0 1.778e-5
* Zero / Pole de degradation CMRR a haute frequence
R_cm1 N_cm_raw N_cm_out 1k
L_cm1 N_cm_raw N_cm_out 159mH

* Sommation Differentiel + Mode Commun + Tension de reference REF
E_out OUT_raw 0 Value = { V(REF) + (V(N_bw) - V(REF))*1.0 + V(N_cm_out) }
* Resistance de sortie
R_out OUT_raw OUT 10
.ends INA823_MACRO

* -------------------------------------------------------------
* DIRECTIVES DE SIMULATION AC
* -------------------------------------------------------------
.ac dec 100 0.01 1Meg

* Notes pour affichage dans LTspice :
* 1) Gain Differentiel : V(OUT_D)/(V(POS_D)-V(NEG_D))
* 2) Gain Mode Commun : V(OUT_CM)/((V(POS_CM)+V(NEG_CM))/2)
* 3) TRMC (dB) : 20*log10(abs((V(OUT_D)/(V(POS_D)-V(NEG_D))) / (V(OUT_CM)/((V(POS_CM)+V(NEG_CM))/2))))

.end

